{"ref":"BDB, פֶּ֫רֶךְ","hw":"פֶּ֫רֶךְ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּ֫רֶךְ</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>harshness, severity</strong>;—in phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּפ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:53\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.53\">Lv 25:53</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּפָ֑רֶךְ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:43\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.43\">43</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:46\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.46\">46</a> (H P), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.4\">Ez 34:4</a> (all c. <span dir=\"rtl\">רדה</span> <em>rule harshly</em>); <a data-ref=\"Exodus 1:13\" href=\"/Exodus.1.13\">Ex 1:13</a> (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּעֲבִדוּ</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 1:14\" href=\"/Exodus.1.14\">14</a> (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲבֹדָה</span>; both P).","next":"BDB, פרך²","prev":"BDB, פרך"}